  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "desc",
   "szText": "{c_label}Cooldown:{/c_label} {c_resource}{Cooldown Time}{/c_resource} seconds\r\nBellow a mighty war cry, increasing your damage dealt by {c_number}[{SF_1}*100|1%x|]{/c} for {c_number}[{SF_2}|1|]{/c} seconds.\r\n\r\nNearby allies gain half of {c_important}War Cry's{/c} effects.",
